Not included, installed separately
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- npm and Python dependencies are installed by their package managers under their own licenses.
  See each package's license in node_modules/ or the media-py virtual environment.
- Fonts used by the design system and renderers (Geist, Geist Mono, Instrument Serif, Montserrat,
  Caveat) are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and are fetched at setup time.
- Speech recognition models (whisper.cpp, Parakeet) are downloaded by `attentionos doctor --fix`
  under their own licenses.
- The optional motion engine depends on Remotion, which requires a paid company license for
  companies with more than three people. AttentionOS asks you to acknowledge this before enabling it.
- Third-party Claude Code skills without a license are never vendored; where their license allows,
  setup offers to install them from their original source.

